# The boot pin grammar: `boot.tree` at the Term root, the release stage0 comes from (08-bootstrap.md, "Stage0, after
# the port", decision 126 of change 001-finish-self-host). Read by task/term/boot.ts through the mill executor.
#
#   boot
#     code <2.10.0>
#     site <oci://ghcr.io/cluesurf/term/code@sha256:…>
#
# `code` is the release's version and `site` its repository and image index digest, the trust anchor. A site with no
# digest pins nothing yet: stage0 is then task/stage0.json's bundle.

mine boot-file
  mine list
    mine any
      mine form, like boot-head
        site boot

mine boot-head
  mine term, term boot
    mine list
      mine any
        mine form, like boot-code
          site code
        mine form, like boot-site
          site site

mine boot-code
  mine term, term code
    mine text
      site text

mine boot-site
  mine term, term site
    mine text
      site text
